      "role": "user",
      "content": "it was weirdly precise though. like, not just random spikes. i tried to time it on my phone but it felt too fast for a standard app to catch the micro-delays correctly. it felt less like \"sound\" and more like a frequency i could just... sense. it was more like:\n\nshort-short-LONG... then a long gap... then short-short-short-short.\n\nit felt like it was reacting to my presence too. does that sound crazy? like, is there any way a data transfer could actually manifest as something that feels rhythmic like that?",
